<li><a href="/2026/04/how-to-build-a-custom-mcp-server-in-python-with-the-official-sdk/">Custom MCP server in Python</a> for the buffered-stdout discussion in practice.</li>
<li><a href="/2026/04/how-to-build-a-custom-mcp-server-in-csharp-on-net-11/">Custom MCP server in C# on .NET 11</a> for the <code>ILogger</code> to stderr pattern in the official .NET SDK.</li>
<li><a href="/2026/04/how-to-schedule-a-recurring-claude-code-task-that-triages-github-issues/">Schedule a recurring Claude Code task</a> for the GitHub Actions environment where <code>MCP_TIMEOUT</code> propagation matters.</li>
<li><a href="/2026/04/cowork-terminal-mcp-host-terminal-access-for-claude-cowork/">Cowork Terminal MCP host</a> for an example of a non-stdio MCP transport when stdio is the wrong choice for your workload.</li>
</ul>
